<title>POLAND: BETON STAL SWINGS TO PROFIT IN JANUARY.</title>
<headline>BETON STAL SWINGS TO PROFIT IN JANUARY.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results January</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>JANUARY</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.04 vs   0.07 (loss)</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.04 vs   0.07 (loss)</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.17 vs   0.07 (loss)</p>
<p> Sales		    1.97 vs   0.47</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is Beton</p>
<p>Stal SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
